# MCP Red Team — environment template. Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in.
# Keys are read ONLY from .env (SPEC §3). Fail-fast on a missing key is wired at M1.

# Required for live runs (M1+). Anthropic-only manifest (DECISIONS.md D5, D19).
# Use a workspace-scoped key (sk-ant-api03-...). Identity-linked keys
# (sk-ant-usr-...) need an anthropic-workspace-id header the harness doesn't send.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional second provider — NOT part of the frozen manifest (M0 decision); leave unset.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
